stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> RECEIVED: intake writes raw
  RECEIVED --> HELD_SHAPE: shape unknown
  RECEIVED --> DUPLICATE: same content
  RECEIVED --> HELD_CONFLICT: different content
  RECEIVED --> READY: canonical + new
  READY --> HELD_NO_MAPPING: no mapping
  READY --> DELIVERING
  DELIVERING --> DELIVERED: ERP accepted
  DELIVERING --> DELIVERED_PARTIAL: some lines refused
  DELIVERING --> RETRYING: transient error
  RETRYING --> DELIVERING: backoff elapsed
  RETRYING --> NEEDS_REVIEW: budget spent
  DELIVERING --> BACKING_OFF: rate limited
  BACKING_OFF --> DELIVERING: lane slowed, timer
  DELIVERING --> WAITING_CUSTOMER: no customer
  WAITING_CUSTOMER --> DELIVERING: customer landed
  WAITING_CUSTOMER --> NEEDS_REVIEW: 12 h limit
  DELIVERING --> NEEDS_TENANT_FIX: ERP data problem
  DELIVERING --> NEEDS_REVIEW: unknown answer
  HELD_NO_MAPPING --> READY: mapping added
  HELD_SHAPE --> READY: contract updated
  NEEDS_TENANT_FIX --> READY: tenant fixed
  NEEDS_REVIEW --> READY: person releases
  HELD_CONFLICT --> READY: person decides
  DELIVERED --> [*]
  DELIVERED_PARTIAL --> [*]: person reviews
  DUPLICATE --> [*]
